### Key Observations  

- Strong peak in ( \Gamma(t) ) at pericentric passage, consistent with density and velocity coupling  
- Persistent cold population (bound substructures) alongside transient hot tail during merger  
- Encounter maps clearly trace halo overlap and density amplification  
- Inner halo shows artificially reduced ( t_{\text{relax}} ), confirming expected finite-N effects  

